  "translation": "Bjalo ka ge go bolela Yahwe: mošomo wa Mitsrayime le thekiso ya Kushe le ya batho ba Sebha — banna ba boleele — o tla tla go wena, gomme ba tla ba ba gago; ba tla latelela wena, ba gatelela ka dikeitla tše tiilego ba tla go wena gomme ba inametše wena, ba tla rapela wena ⟨go⟩ wena: Ruri El o aka go wena, gomme ga go ⟨selo⟩ se sengwe, ga go Elohim ⟨a mangwe⟩.",
